---

**Summary of the fix:** build chains from the *SQ array*, fold the raw completion stream through an explicit link/drain/timeout state machine (failure ⇒ `-ECANCELED` tail; link timeout fires ⇒ target `-ECANCELED` + timeout `-ETIME`; disarm ⇒ timeout `-ECANCELED`; drain ⇒ barrier buffering; `CQE_SKIP_SUCCESS` ⇒ drop only `res >= 0`; `ASYNC` ⇒ defer), and validate `user_data` uniqueness and issued-op references in kernel order. All 16 conformance tests pass under `go1.26`.
